<%# 領域が 0 件の画像を選んで、まとめてページ全体で構造化する。uploads: 領域 0 件の Upload、url: 送り先 %>
<% if current_user.can_write? && uploads.any? %>
  <%= form_with url: url, method: :post, id: "extract-whole", class: "mb-6 rounded-xl bg-surface p-4", data: { controller: "bulk-select" } do |f| %>
    <p class="text-lg font-bold mb-2">赤枠がなく領域が 0 件の画像（<%= uploads.size %> 枚）</p>
    <ul id="whole-candidates" class="mb-3 grid gap-2 sm:grid-cols-2">
      <% uploads.each do |u| %>
        <li><label class="flex items-center gap-3 min-h-11 text-lg cursor-pointer">
          <%= check_box_tag "upload_ids[]", u.id, true, id: "whole_upload_#{u.id}", class: "w-6 h-6", data: { bulk_select_target: "item", action: "bulk-select#update" } %>
          <img src="<%= image_upload_path(u) %>" alt="" loading="lazy" class="w-16 h-12 object-cover rounded">
          <span>画像 #<%= u.id %></span>
        </label></li>
      <% end %>
    </ul>
    <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-3">
      <button type="button" class="btn-secondary" data-action="bulk-select#checkAll">全部選ぶ</button>
      <button type="button" class="btn-secondary" data-action="bulk-select#uncheckAll">全部外す</button>
      <label class="flex items-center gap-1 text-lg"><%= hidden_field_tag :generate_answers, "0", id: nil %><%= check_box_tag :generate_answers, "1", true, id: "generate_answers_whole" %>教材に解答が無いときは AI で解答を作る</label>
      <%= button_tag type: "submit", id: "extract-whole-submit", class: "btn-primary cursor-pointer disabled:opacity-50 disabled:cursor-not-allowed", data: { bulk_select_target: "button" } do %><span>選んだ画像をページ全体で構造化する（<span data-bulk-select-target="count"><%= uploads.size %></span> 枚を構造化）</span><% end %>
    </div>
    <p class="mt-2 text-lg text-text-sub">ページ全体を 1 つの領域として読み取ります。Gemini の日次上限を超えた分は、翌日に自動で再開します。</p>
  <% end %>
<% end %>
